- Rewrote `src/widgets/PlotImage/PlotImageWidget.tsx`. When `sourceLanguage: 'python'` and the panel is open, it renders an editable CodeMirror (line numbers, history, indent-on-input, bracketMatching, python(), the codeRunner theme) with Run + Reset buttons and a `Mod-Enter` keymap. Run dispatches via `usePyodide().runWithPlotParam({ setupCode: '', renderCode, params: {}, outputType: 'plot' })` — reusing the matplotlib/AGG capture path from US-045 (no new worker handler needed). Returned PNG becomes a blob URL and the figure `<img>` swaps src + flips `data-plotimage-rendered="true"`. Reset restores the original code via `view.dispatch` and clears the live blob (revoking the URL). Errors surface inline with a Show traceback toggle; loading + running states gate the button. R remains read-only (Pyodide is Python-only).
